OL,3,GNEWSA'Power Slap world title would
OL,4,Achange my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next 24 hours could change Darren
OL,7,FGodfrey's life.
OL,9,FThe 38-year-old is aiming for Power
OL,10,FSlap glory by becoming middleweight
OL,11,Fworld champion in Doha, Qatar.
OL,13,FGodfrey, of Church Stretton,
OL,14,FShropshire, will face Isaiah Quinones,
OL,15,Ffrom California, who is reigning
OL,16,Fmiddleweight world champion, and boasts
OL,17,Fthe most knockouts in Power Slap
OL,18,Fmiddleweight history.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
