OL,3,GNEWSA'Power Slap world title would
OL,4,Achange my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I know I've got a job to do, and he's
OL,7,Fthe man that's stood in my way, I'll
OL,8,Fshow him no mercy on the night but I'll
OL,9,Fshake his hand when I pick him up,"
OL,10,FGodfrey, known in the sport as
OL,11,FTarantula, told the BBC.
